  "raw_text": "User: I would order a McDonald's Big Mac. Agent: And why do you consider the McDonald's Big Mac to be the closest replacement for your favorite pizza? User: It's not really a replacement but it's just something I also like. Agent: I see. So it's another favorite of yours. Can you name two or three other similar items you also like, from any chain? User: Uh, I like Italian subs from Papa John's, uh Jimmy John's. I like garlic wings from Wingstop. Agent: Okay, you mentioned Italian subs from Jimmy John's. Compared to your favorite Papa John's pepperoni pizza, what's better or worse about the Italian sub? User: Um, it's not really better or worse. The sub is cold, the pizza's hot. They taste a little bit different. Agent: Understood. And how about the garlic wings from Wingstop? What's better or worse about them compared to your favorite pizza? User: Sometimes they're very greasy. Usually they're good. Agent: Thank you. What do you usually pair with your Papa John's pepperoni pizza? This",
